	(text "S3 Jack Hat - designed, not ordered, not built. Source: written for Pulsar. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later\nGenerated by tools/gen_schematic.py - edit the script, not this sheet. README: hardware/s3-jack-hat/README.md\nNo battery, no charger, no USB, no boost: the stick runs on its own battery or USB-C.\nJACK_SLEEVE / JACK_TIP / JACK_RING are the camera side, isolated from GND by the optocouplers.\nJ1 orientation (tools/hat2.py GND_CORNER) is UNVERIFIED until GND is found on the stick with a meter."
